From 4e0dbaaea40700ef24e4ec40a099f9dd88a348b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 12 Jul 2026 22:20:59 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 235/273] drm/sun4i: Add DE3 writeback support

Expose DE3 RT-WB as a DRM writeback connector.

Support RGB and YUV420 output, scaling and interrupt completion.

Use the input graph to identify the source mixer and CRTC.

Signed-off-by: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/Makefile            |   2 +-
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun4i_drv.c         |  22 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun4i_framebuffer.c |  26 +-
 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun50i_wb.c         | 549 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 597 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun50i_wb.c

